---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Chassis Assets Documentation">
  <div class="hero">
    <span class="badge">v0.1.0</span>
    <h1>🎨 Design Asset Management</h1>
    <p class="lead">Centralized management and distribution of design assets for the Chassis Design System.</p>
  </div>

  <section>
    <h2>🚀 Getting Started</h2>
    <p>Chassis Assets provides a structured approach to managing design assets across different brands and applications.</p>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>📁 Asset Organization</h3>
        <p>Structured directory system for fonts, images, and icons across multiple brands.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>🔄 Build System</h3>
        <p>Automated processing and optimization of assets for different platforms.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>📊 Asset Analysis</h3>
        <p>Built-in tools to analyze and report on asset usage and optimization.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>📂 Directory Structure</h2>
    <pre class="code-block"><code>source/
├── default/              # Fallback assets for all brands
│   ├── web/             # Web application assets
│   │   ├── fonts/       # Typography assets
│   │   ├── images/      # Bitmap images and illustrations
│   │   └── icons/       # Icon assets (SVG preferred)
│   └── mobile/          # Mobile application assets
└── [brand]/             # Brand-specific overrides
    └── [app]/           # Application-specific assets
        ├── fonts/
        ├── images/
        └── icons/</code></pre>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>🛠️ Available Commands</h2>
    <div class="command-list">
      <div class="command">
        <code>npm run build</code>
        <span>Build all assets for all brands</span>
      </div>
      <div class="command">
        <code>npm run analyze</code>
        <span>Analyze asset usage and optimization opportunities</span>
      </div>
      <div class="command">
        <code>npm run copy</code>
        <span>Copy assets to target directories</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>📋 Quick Links</h2>
    <ul class="link-list">
      <li><a href="/chassis-assets/guidelines/">Asset Guidelines</a> - Best practices and organization</li>
      <li><a href="/chassis-assets/api/">API Reference</a> - Build system documentation</li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/ozgurgunes/chassis-assets">GitHub Repository</a> - Source code and issues</li>
      <li><a href="/">Main Documentation</a> - Complete Chassis Design System docs</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
    color: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-top: -1rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 0 0;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .card {
    background: #f8f9fa;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
  }

  .card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    color: #495057;
  }

  .code-block {
    background: #f8f9fa;
    border: 1px solid #e9ecef;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 1rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: 'SF Mono', Monaco, 'Cascadia Code', 'Roboto Mono', Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;
  }

  .command-list {
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .command {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    background: #f8f9fa;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border-left: 3px solid #667eea;
  }

  .command code {
    background: #e9ecef;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: 'SF Mono', Monaco, 'Cascadia Code', 'Roboto Mono', Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;
  }

  .link-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .link-list li {
    margin: 0.75rem 0;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    background: #f8f9fa;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border-left: 3px solid #28a745;
  }

  .link-list a {
    color: #667eea;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .link-list a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
